+// ---- decomp research: software read-watch on a VA range (effect->seq remap) ----
+// The fork's gdbstub Z3 watchpoints are no-ops, so implement one in the JIT read
+// callback. Armed by the SDL frontend from /tmp/hook_arm ("lo hi" hex); every
